# Simple Ansible Automation Example

Install LDAP using Ansible:

```yaml
---
- hosts: ldapserver
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Install OpenLDAP
      apt:
        name:
          - slapd
          - ldap-utils
        state: present
```

Run playbook:

```bash
ansible-playbook ldap.yml
```

---

